title: "SiteSurveyor Framework"
abstract: >-
  Survey operations, evidence and settlement in one workspace: a multi-tenant
  platform for field survey work covering project records, geospatial analysis
  over Earth-observation coverages, an AI assistant surface, marketplace and
  transport listings, and wallet-based authentication and settlement.
